   300	/**
   301	 * Validate a user SQL query and produce an org-scoped version.
   302	 *
   303	 * Validation pipeline:
   304	 *   1. validateTableQuery() — @polyglot-sql/sdk parses the SQL and checks
   305	 *      all table/column references against the allowlisted schema
   306	 *   2. extractTableRefs() — @polyglot-sql/sdk AST extracts table names
   307	 *   3. buildScopedQuery() — wraps each table reference in an org-scoped CTE
